  "project_description": "This module provides a field widget for selecting a Jotform Form Id.\n\n Features \n As well as a field widget for selecting a Jotform Form Id, the module provides a service for instantiating a Jotform API client using https://github.com/jotform/jotform-api-php .\n\n Post-Installation \n Visit /admin/config/services/jotform-field-widget and configure a Jotform API key.\n\n The Jotform Field Widget can be used on any string field type.\n\n Back to top",
